NC Digital provides local SEO services for businesses across Wales — helping you rank higher on Google, appear in local map results, and attract more customers from your area.

We're based in Merthyr Tydfil, South Wales. We've helped businesses in Cardiff, Swansea, Newport, the Valleys, and beyond get to page 1 on Google for searches their customers are already making.

## Why local SEO matters for Welsh businesses

Wales has a thriving small business economy — but most customers search online before they ever make contact. If your business isn't showing on the first page of Google when someone searches for your service in your area, you're losing those enquiries to a competitor who is.

Local SEO is how you fix that. It targets the searches that matter — people in your area, already looking for what you offer. No paid ads, no ongoing spend on clicks — just consistent organic traffic and leads.

## What our Wales SEO service includes

- Local keyword research targeting your town and service area
- Google Business Profile optimisation for Google Maps visibility
- On-page SEO across your key service and location pages
- Local citation building across directories (Yell, Yelp, Bing Places, local directories)
- Technical SEO audit and fixes
- Link building to build your site's authority
- Monthly reporting in plain English — rankings, traffic, enquiries

